WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.804
- You are pregnant. That's crazy cool.

00:00:01.804 --> 00:00:02.710
- [Mandy] I'm pregnant.

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:05.080
- How excited are you?

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.590
- I am very excited.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:07.920
- How did you break the
news to your family?

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.910
'Cause this is kind of a crap year, like,

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:10.970
you can't really be around everybody.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.000
Did you get to be around
anybody and tell them?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.380
- I, not really.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.130
So my parents, we broke
the news, like, you know,

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:18.788
via Zoom, which was lovely,

00:00:18.788 --> 00:00:22.494
but not the way that you sort
of had built up in your brain,

00:00:22.494 --> 00:00:25.490
but my in-laws live very close to us

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.010
and it was my mother-in-law's
birthday, and we decided like,

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.520
this is the perfect birthday gift for her.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.400
We're gonna, we're gonna
like give her a picture

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.530
of the ultrasound.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.538
And so we gave her a
gift and we were like,

00:00:35.538 --> 00:00:37.190
"Open your card at the end."

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:39.940
And the card just said,
"Happy birthday, Grandma."

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:42.690
And she read the card and
was like, "Oh, thanks."

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.300
Like a little insulted, I think,

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.797
that we were calling her "Grandma."

00:00:45.797 --> 00:00:46.630
- (laughs)

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.040
- And then my husband took
a picture of the ultrasound

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.829
out of his pocket and like
tossed it down on the table.

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:55.236
And I never heard a human
being make the sound

00:00:55.236 --> 00:00:56.380
that she made.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:01:00.100
It was like a cry and a scream.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.380
And exasperation, like,
it was, I was very worried

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.470
that she was gonna have a heart attack.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.570
I'm like, "Kathy, you've got to breathe.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.040
Like everything. It's good news.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:08.873
It's happy news."

00:01:08.873 --> 00:01:10.818
She was just so beside
herself with excitement.

00:01:10.818 --> 00:01:13.480
- I love that she was
insulted because she was like,

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:16.470
"So you're old." (laughs)

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:17.953
That's my favorite part.

